# Cache Components (do not undo)

`next.config.ts` has `cacheComponents: true`. Soft-nav and iOS/Android swipe-back hang if these are reverted.

## Never re-add `src/app/**/loading.tsx` on

`collections/[handle]`, `emily-in-paris`, `shraddhas-favourite` (+ `/pages/` aliases), `cart`, `products/[handle]`, `(marketing)` home, `search`, `wishlist`.

That file wraps the whole segment. Next then sticks the skeleton after soft-nav and replaces the Activity-preserved page on gesture-back. `StreamingPageShell` / page `<Suspense>` already owns the fallback.

## Public catalog + CMS SSR

`collection.service.server` and `cms-page.service.server` (and their `generateMetadata`) use `createPublicServerApi()` only. Do not call `createServerApi()` / `cookies()` there.

## Page Suspense, not layout Suspense

Uncached `fetch` / `searchParams` must sit inside a **page-level** `<Suspense>`. A layout `StreamingPageShell` is too high (`blocking-prerender-dynamic` on `/`). Keep `HomeCmsPage` → `<Suspense fallback={<HomePageSkeleton />}>` around `HomeCmsMain`.

## Do not revert

- `export const prefetch = 'partial'` on listing / PDP / cart / home / search
- `StreamingPageShell` main = `StableMainSuspense` (not raw `<Suspense>`)
- `CartPageContent` must not gate the skeleton on `useAuth().isLoading`
- `NavigationPendingProvider` clears on `popstate` + persisted `pageshow`; pathname arrival is enough (cart UTMs must not hold the overlay)
